<title>USA: Suzuki April US car sales fall. [CORRECTED 18:40 gmt]</title>
<headline>Suzuki April US car sales fall. [CORRECTED 18:40 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suzuki Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Apr 1-30, 1997     Apr 1-30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car		  57		 158	    -63.9</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	     386		 656	    -41.2</p>
<p> Import Car		   432		 499	    -13.4</p>
<p> Import Truck	     1,220	     1,066	    +14.4</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Apr 30, 1997 Jan 1-Apr 30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car		 630	     1,807	    -64.8</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   1,568	     2,907	    -45.5</p>
<p> Import Car		 3,234	     2,206	    +48.0</p>
<p> Import Truck	     5,052	     5,052	     +1.0</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26, 102 for year to date vs 103 in year ago. (In April 1997 chart, company corrected figures for domestic and import trucks to 386 and 1,220, respectively, from 426 and 1,180).</p>
</text>
